<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>IronFitness - Supere Seus Limites</title>
    <style>
        /* --- ESTILOS GERAIS --- */
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Arial Black', Gadget, sans-serif;
        }

        html {
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        :root {
            --primary: #ff4a00; /* Laranja de alta energia */
            --dark-bg: #0d0d0d;
            --card-bg: #1a1a1a;
            --text-light: #ffffff;
            --text-gray: #a3a3a3;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--dark-bg);
            color: var(--text-light);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* --- NAVEGAÇÃO --- */
        header {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            background-color: rgba(13, 13, 13, 0.95);
            padding: 1.2rem 2rem;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            z-index: 1000;
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--primary);
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            color: var(--text-light);
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .logo span {
            color: var(--primary);
        }

        nav a {
            color: var(--text-light);
            text-decoration: none;
            margin-left: 1.5rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            transition: color 0.3s;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            color: var(--primary);
        }

        /* --- SEÇÃO HERO --- */
        .hero {
            height: 100vh;
            background: linear-gradient(rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5), rgba(13, 13, 13, 0.9)), 
                        url('https://unsplash.com') no-repeat center center/cover;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 0 1rem;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 4rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .hero h1 span {
            color: var(--primary);
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            color: var(--text-gray);
            max-width: 600px;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        }

        .btn {
            background-color: var(--primary);
            color: var(--text-light);
            padding: 1rem 2.5rem;
            border: none;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-decoration: none;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background 0.3s, transform 0.2s;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }

        .btn:hover {
            background-color: #e04100;
            transform: scale(1.05);
        }

        /* --- SEÇÕES PRINCIPAIS --- */
        .section {
            padding: 6rem 2rem;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .section-title {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 4rem;
        }

        .section-title span {
            color: var(--primary);
        }

        /* --- GRID DE MODALIDADES --- */
        .grid-modalidades {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 2rem;
        }

        .card {
            background-color: var(--card-bg);
            border-radius: 8px;
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid #262626;
            transition: border-color 0.3s, transform 0.3s;
        }

        .card:hover {
            border-color: var(--primary);
            transform: translateY(-5px);
        }

        .card-img {
            height: 220px;
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;
        }

        /* Imagens específicas do Unsplash para cada modalidade */
        .img-musculacao { background-image: url('https://unsplash.com'); }
        .img-funcional { background-image: url('https://unsplash.com'); }
        .img-cardio { background-image: url('https://unsplash.com'); }

        .card-body {
            padding: 1.5rem;
        }

        .card-body h3 {
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            font-size: 1.3rem;
        }

        .card-body p {
            color: var(--text-gray);
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        /* --- PLANOS --- */
        .grid-planos {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 2rem;
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .plano-box {
            background-color: var(--card-bg);
            padding: 3rem 2rem;
            text-align: center;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border: 2px solid transparent;
            position: relative;
        }

        .plano-box.destaque {
            border-color: var(--primary);
        }

        .tag-destaque {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
            background-color: var(--primary);
            padding: 0.3rem 1rem;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            border-radius: 20px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .plano-box h3 {
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .preco {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            color: var(--text-light);
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .preco span {
            font-size: 1rem;
            color: var(--text-gray);
        }

        .plano-box ul {
            list-style: none;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            color: var(--text-gray);
        }

        .plano-box ul li {
            margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
        }

        /* --- CALCULADORA DE IMC (JAVASCRIPT INTERATIVO) --- */
        .imc-container {
            background-color: var(--card-bg);
            padding: 2.5rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            max-width: 500px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            border: 1px solid #262626;
        }

        .form-group {
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .form-group label {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .form-group input {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 0.8rem;
            background-color: #0d0d0d;
            border: 1px solid #444;
            color: white;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }

        .resultado-imc {
            margin-top: 1.5rem;
            padding: 1rem;
            border-radius: 4px;
            text-align: center;
            font-weight: bold;
            display: none;
        }

        /* --- RODAPÉ --- */
        footer {
            background-color: #050505;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 2rem;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            color: var(--text-gray);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            border-top: 1px solid #262626;
        }

        /* --- RESPONSIVIDADE --- */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .hero h1 { font-size: 2.5rem; }
            header { padding: 1rem; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; }
            nav a { margin: 0 0.5rem; }
            .section { padding: 4rem 1rem; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- MENU DE NAVEGAÇÃO -->
    <header>
        <div class="logo">Iron<span>Fitness</span></div>
        <nav>
            <a href="#inicio">Início</a>
            <a href="#modalidades">Modalidades</a>
            <a href="#planos">Planos</a>
            <a href="#imc">Calcule seu IMC</a>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <!-- BANNER DE ENTRADA (HERO) -->
    <section id="inicio" class="hero">
        <h1>Construa sua melhor <span>versão</span></h1>
        <p>Ambiente moderno, os melhores equipamentos do mercado e professores prontos para guiar sua evolução física.</p>
        <a href="#planos" class="btn">Matricule-se já</a>
    </section>

    <!-- MODALIDADES -->
    <section id="modalidades" class="section">
        <h2 class="section-title">Nossas <span>Modalidades</span></h2>
        <div class="grid-modalidades">
            
            <div class="card">
                <div class="card-img img-musculacao"></div>
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h3>Musculação</h3>
                    <p>Equipamentos biomeânicos de ponta para hipertrofia, ganho de força e definição muscular com segurança.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <div class="card-img img-funcional"></div>
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h3>Treino Funcional</h3>
                    <p>Circuitos dinâmicos focados em agilidade, queima calórica acelerada e fortalecimento do core.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <div class="card-img img-cardio"></div>
